<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1487071753"/></metadata></head><body dur="5:49.003"><div begin="19.907" end="55.538" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="19.907" end="26.707" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.907" end="20.834">突如其</span><span begin="20.834" end="21.496">来</span><span begin="21.496" end="21.688">的</span><span begin="21.688" end="22.400">美梦</span> <span begin="23.414" end="24.085">是你</span><span begin="24.085" end="24.926">离去时</span><span begin="24.926" end="25.840">卷起的</span><span begin="25.840" end="26.707">泡沫</span></p><p begin="29.495" end="36.797" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.495" end="30.720">踢着石头</span> <span begin="30.996" end="32.347">默默的走</span> <span begin="34.228" end="35.532">公车从旁</span><span begin="35.532" end="36.115">擦身</span><span begin="36.115" end="36.797">而过</span></p><p begin="39.115" end="45.883" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.115" end="40.042">突如其</span><span begin="40.042" end="40.670">来</span><span begin="40.670" end="40.929">的</span><span begin="40.929" end="41.610">念头</span> <span begin="42.678" end="43.286">幻想</span><span begin="43.286" end="43.637">化</span><span begin="43.637" end="44.225">成</span><span begin="44.225" end="44.852">流星</span><span begin="44.852" end="45.386">的你</span><span begin="45.386" end="45.883">我</span></p><p begin="48.774" end="51.791" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.774" end="49.549">明亮的</span><span begin="49.549" end="49.979">夜</span> <span begin="50.079" end="51.067">漆黑的</span><span begin="51.067" end="51.407">宇</span><span begin="51.407" end="51.791">宙</span></p><p begin="53.528" end="55.538" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.528" end="54.111">通通</span><span begin="54.111" end="54.725">来自</span><span begin="54.725" end="54.984">夜</span><span begin="54.984" end="55.538">空</span></p></div><div begin="57.741" end="1:15.892" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="57.741" end="1:01.491" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="